      "content": "idk i dont know if talking to anyone would even matter. it's just that everyone is already gone. i'm looking at my phone and there's nothing. no one wants to hear from me. it's like the world just moved on without me and i'm just stuck in this weird limbo where i'm still breathing but i'm not really part of anything anymore.",
