    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to believe anyone is \"still around\" when my whole life used to be those people. it feels so fake to pretend i'm still part of society when i've basically been erased. it's like the version of me that lived in their heads is gone. if i'm already a ghost, what's even the point of trying to be \"real\" anymore?",
